==================================================
        JAVA FX + DB PROJECT CHEAT SHEET
==================================================

PREREQUISITES:
- Java JDK 17 or 21 installed.
- No need to install Maven manually (we use the wrapper script).

--------------------------------------------------
HOW TO RUN THE APPLICATION (Main Command):
--------------------------------------------------
Windows (PowerShell / Terminal):
  .\mvnw clean javafx:run

Mac / Linux:
  ./mvnw clean javafx:run

--------------------------------------------------
OTHER USEFUL COMMANDS:
--------------------------------------------------
1. Test / Verify (Runs unit tests):
   Windows:   .\mvnw test
   Mac/Linux: ./mvnw test

2. Quick Compile (Checks for syntax/import errors):
   Windows:   .\mvnw compile
   Mac/Linux: ./mvnw compile

3. Reset Build (Fixes weird errors or stuck builds):
   Windows:   .\mvnw clean
   Mac/Linux: ./mvnw clean

--------------------------------------------------
TROUBLESHOOTING / VS CODE TIPS:
--------------------------------------------------
- If VS Code shows red underline errors after adding libraries to pom.xml:
  Run: .\mvnw clean compile

- Permission denied on Mac/Linux when running ./mvnw?
  Run: chmod +x mvnw